{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHAIN CORP</strong> is a card battler set in a decaying corporate hellscape.<br><br> Note* <i>JOIN THE PLAYTEST, YOUR FEEDBACK CAN HAVE A BIG IMPACT ON THE PROJECT AT THIS STAGE OF DEVELOPMENT</i><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>MAIN MECHANICS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple 20 card decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards are played onto FIELD SLOTS that can be destroyed or created during play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHARACTER cards stand and fight on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CORPORATE cards are instant with effects like manipulating resources, direct damage, or drawing cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are eight DAMAGE TYPES and each boss has unique weaknesses/resistances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BUDGET is how you pay for cards and SALARY is how much budget you gain each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hand refills at the end of every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LIQUIDATE cards at will from your hand for instant resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The CORRUPTION meter consistently rises and must be carefully balanced or you will lose resources each turn.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812890?t=1753542647","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812890?t=1753542647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/4a9346bfe96abccbd30958bd2dd5b3ae1c25c943/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753542647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/4a9346bfe96abccbd30958bd2dd5b3ae1c25c943/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753542647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHAIN CORP</strong> is a card battler set in a decaying corporate hellscape.<br><br> Note* <i>JOIN THE PLAYTEST, YOUR FEEDBACK CAN HAVE A BIG IMPACT ON THE PROJECT AT THIS STAGE OF DEVELOPMENT</i><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>MAIN MECHANICS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple 20 card decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards are played onto FIELD SLOTS that can be destroyed or created during play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHARACTER cards stand and fight on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CORPORATE cards are instant with effects like manipulating resources, direct damage, or drawing cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are eight DAMAGE TYPES and each boss has unique weaknesses/resistances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BUDGET is how you pay for cards and SALARY is how much budget you gain each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hand refills at the end of every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LIQUIDATE cards at will from your hand for instant resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The CORRUPTION meter consistently rises and must be carefully balanced or you will lose resources each turn.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Valentino Quijano-Moeckel"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812890/96ef433ccb75e7f08074c01ae6ae9accd006893e/header.jpg?t=1753542647","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257170593,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170593/movie480.mp4?t=1753223780","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170593/movie_max.mp4?t=1753223780"},"name":"Chain Corp Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.aka